WEBVTT

00:00:01.020 --> 00:00:03.314
SIRIUS:
Harry, I couldn't risk sending Hedwig.

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:06.859
Since the World Cup, the Ministry's
been intercepting more and more owls...

00:00:07.026 --> 00:00:09.111
...and she's too easily recognized.

00:00:09.361 --> 00:00:12.197
We need to talk, Harry, face-to-face.

00:00:12.364 --> 00:00:16.619
Meet me in the Gryffindor common room,
1:00 this Saturday night.

00:00:16.827 --> 00:00:18.495
And make sure you're alone.

00:00:18.746 --> 00:00:20.122
Sirius.

00:00:20.372 --> 00:00:21.957
-P.S.:
-Aah!

00:00:22.041 --> 00:00:23.876
The bird bites.

00:00:24.877 --> 00:00:25.878
Aah.

00:00:34.094 --> 00:00:35.638
Sirius?

00:00:52.488 --> 00:00:54.365
RITA:
Harry Potter, age 12...

00:00:54.531 --> 00:00:57.534
...suspect entrant
in the Triwizard Tournament.

00:00:57.743 --> 00:01:00.245
His eyes swimming
with the ghosts of his past...

00:01:00.412 --> 00:01:02.081
...and choking back tears-- Aah!

00:01:04.917 --> 00:01:06.418
[FIRE HISSES]

00:01:09.088 --> 00:01:10.756
[HISSES]

00:01:15.052 --> 00:01:17.304
[GASPS]

00:01:17.513 --> 00:01:20.099
Sirius. How--?

00:01:20.182 --> 00:01:22.810
I don't have much time,
so let me get straight to it.

00:01:23.060 --> 00:01:25.938
Did you or did you not put your name
into the Goblet of Fire?

00:01:26.105 --> 00:01:27.523
-No!
-Shh.

00:01:28.107 --> 00:01:29.316
I had to ask.

00:01:29.566 --> 00:01:34.321
Now, tell me about this dream of yours.
You mentioned Wormtail and Voldemort.

00:01:34.530 --> 00:01:37.032
But who was the third man in the room?

00:01:37.116 --> 00:01:39.576
-I don't know.
-You didn't hear a name?

00:01:40.452 --> 00:01:42.079
No.

00:01:42.955 --> 00:01:46.583
Voldemort was giving him a job to do.
Something important.

00:01:46.834 --> 00:01:48.127
And what was that?

00:01:50.212 --> 00:01:51.964
He wanted...

00:01:52.131 --> 00:01:53.799
...me.

00:01:54.216 --> 00:01:58.595
I don't know why. But he was
gonna use this man to get to me.

00:01:59.972 --> 00:02:02.099
But, I mean, it was only a dream, right?

00:02:02.474 --> 00:02:04.101
Yes.

00:02:04.184 --> 00:02:05.853
It's just a dream.

00:02:06.562 --> 00:02:08.063
Look, Harry.

00:02:08.147 --> 00:02:11.608
The Death Eaters at the World Cup,
your name rising from that goblet...

00:02:11.859 --> 00:02:15.863
...these are not just coincidences.
Hogwarts isn't safe anymore.

00:02:16.113 --> 00:02:17.072
What are you saying?

00:02:17.156 --> 00:02:21.452
I'm saying the devils are inside
the walls. Igor Karkaroff?

00:02:21.618 --> 00:02:26.081
He was a Death Eater. And no one,
no one stops being a Death Eater.

00:02:26.165 --> 00:02:28.625
Then there's Barty Crouch.
Heart of stone.

00:02:28.834 --> 00:02:30.210
Sent his own son to Azkaban.

00:02:30.377 --> 00:02:32.379
[DOOR OPENING IN DISTANCE]

00:02:36.383 --> 00:02:38.510
You think one of them
put my name in the goblet?

00:02:38.761 --> 00:02:41.096
I haven't a clue who put your name
in that goblet...

00:02:41.180 --> 00:02:45.184
...but whoever did is no friend to you.
People die in this tournament.

00:02:45.267 --> 00:02:48.771
-I'm not ready for this, Sirius.
-You don't have a choice.

00:02:49.021 --> 00:02:50.522
[FOOTSTEPS APPROACHING]

00:02:52.274 --> 00:02:54.777
-Someone's coming.
-Keep your friends close, Harry.

00:02:58.155 --> 00:03:00.115
-Who were you talking to?
-What?

00:03:00.199 --> 00:03:02.618
-Who says I was talking to anyone?
-I heard voices.

00:03:02.993 --> 00:03:06.997
Maybe you're imagining things.
Wouldn't be the first time.

00:03:07.414 --> 00:03:10.793
You're probably just practicing
for your next interview, I expect.

00:03:36.693 --> 00:03:38.278
NEVILLE:
Amazing.

00:03:40.239 --> 00:03:43.575
-Amazing!
-Neville. You're doing it again.

00:03:43.826 --> 00:03:46.078
Oh, right, sorry.

00:03:46.912 --> 00:03:49.915
"Magical Water Plants
of the Highland Lochs"?

00:03:50.082 --> 00:03:53.252
Moody gave it to me.
That day we had tea.

00:03:54.711 --> 00:03:56.338
It's already been through enough people.

00:03:56.588 --> 00:03:58.715
Why don't you just go
and talk to him yourself?

00:04:00.259 --> 00:04:02.469
Ron, this is your problem, not mine.

00:04:02.678 --> 00:04:04.263
What do you want me to say again?

00:04:04.429 --> 00:04:06.265
You do it. Go.

00:04:09.268 --> 00:04:13.272
Ronald would like me to tell you
that Seamus told him...

00:04:13.981 --> 00:04:17.484
...that Dean was told by Parvati
that Hagrid's looking for you.

00:04:17.734 --> 00:04:20.195
Is that right? Well, you--

00:04:20.279 --> 00:04:21.321
What?

00:04:22.281 --> 00:04:23.949
Uh....

00:04:26.451 --> 00:04:29.371
-Are you sure you won't do this?
-You do it.

00:04:32.291 --> 00:04:35.294
Dean was told by Parvati that....

00:04:36.378 --> 00:04:38.630
Please don't ask me to say it again.

00:04:39.131 --> 00:04:40.465
Hagrid's looking for you.

00:04:41.091 --> 00:04:44.136
-Well, you can tell Ronald--
-I'm not an owl!

